  "description": "A man who used to be in charge of squeezing subcontractors for lower prices at a major corporation wakes up in the body of a Fair Trade Commission investigator after an accident. When he encounters a major contractor stealing the technology of small and medium-sized businesses using the very same tactics he once employed, he sets out to find the rightful owner of the blueprints, caught between victims who remain silent and whistleblowers brave enough to speak up. This branded webtoon is a campaign by the Fair Trade Commission, illustrated by artist Taibogi, aimed at eradicating the misappropriation of technology.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
